        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this bright and spacious two-bedroom apartment to the market, ideally positioned on the second floor of this secure and well-maintained development at 68 Jervis Street in the heart of Dublin 1. No. 12 comes to the market vacant and is sure to appeal to first-time buyers and investors alike.\n\nThe location is second to none, with Dublin City Centre quite literally on your doorstep. Jervis Shopping Centre, Henry Street, O'Connell Street and Temple Bar are all within easy walking distance, along with an abundance of shops, cafés, restaurants and recreational amenities. The property is also exceptionally well serviced by public transport, with the LUAS, Dublin Bus and numerous transport links all close by.\n\nBright and well-laid-out internal living accommodation of c. 51 sq.m comprises entrance hallway, fully fitted kitchen, large living room with access to a spacious private balcony, two double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes and main bathroom complete with bath/shower, WC and wash hand basin.\n\nNo. 12 benefits from laminate flooring throughout much of the accommodation, double-glazed windows and electric heating. The fully fitted kitchen comes with an electric hob and tiled flooring, while the generous living room provides an excellent living space and direct access to the balcony. Further benefits include lift access, telecom/intercom system, BER C rating and vacant possession.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a two-bedroom apartment in a highly convenient Dublin City Centre location. Early viewing is highly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 086 832 3302 or 01 541 1455 to arrange a viewing.\nKey Features\n \n<ul>\n <li>c.51 sq.m\n• BER C\n• 2nd Floor Apartment\n• Fitted Wardrobes\n• Large Living Room\n• Spacious Private Balcony\n• Fully Fitted Kitchen\n• Electric Hob\n• Main Bathroom\n• Electric Heating\n• Double Glazed Windows\n• Laminate Flooring\n• Lift Access\n• Secure & Well-Maintained Development\n• Telecom/Intercom System\n• Vacant Possession\n• Prime Dublin City Centre Location\n• Excellent Transport Links\n• Ideal for First Time Buyers & Investors\n• Viewing Highly Advised</li>\n</ul>\n \nDirections D01 KX58"
      },
      {
